      "title": "Recruit",
      "description": "Clinical Positions in Cardiology 2026-2027 (JPF11008) - UCLA Academic RECRUIT Skip to main content Recruit Home Open Recruitments Clinical Positions in Cardiology 2026-2027 (JPF11008) Clinical Positions in Cardiology 2026-2027 Apply now to Clinical Positions in Cardiology 2026-2027 Job #JPF11008 Medicine-Cardiology / David Geffen School Of Medicine / UCLA Position overview Salary range: The posted UC Salary Scales set the minimum pay determined by rank and step at appointment. See Table 5. The salary range for this position is $146,700-$1,300,000. This position includes membership in the Health Sciences Compensation Plan , which provides for eligibility for additional compensation. Application Window Open date: July 1, 2026 Most recent review date: Thursday, Aug 20, 2026 at 11:59pm (Pacific Time) Applications received after this date will be reviewed by the search committee if the position has not yet been filled. Final date: Wednesday, Dec 30, 2026 at 11:59pm (Pacific Time) Applications will continue to be accepted until this date, but those received after the review date will only be considered if the position has not yet been filled. Position description The Division of Cardiology in the Department of Medicine at the David Geffen School of Medicine at UCLA is seeking applications for Clinician-Educator positions in the Health Sciences Clinical Professor series at the Instructor, Assistant, Associate, or full Professor ranks. The position involves participating in university-based general cardiology practices throughout the greater Los Angeles area. Candidates are expected to be board-eligible or board-certified in Cardiology. Additional training in EP, MR and/or CT imaging is desirable but not essential. The candidate will participate in teaching medical students, residents and cardiology fellows, in addition to full-time clinical activities. An M.D., D.O., or equivalent is required. The shared values of the DGSOM are expressed in the Cultur